{"3704540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unending Aqua", "steam_appid": 3704540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4812460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unending Aqua</strong> is a single-player 3D first-person adventure game with elements of psychological horror. It is inspired by liminal spaces and the poolrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/8b78182f630fc760f0bc051ee27cc2bd.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"\"width=908 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/4dc1af67b52373f7eb3638f417ec2997.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Story\" width=128 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do when your dream vacation turns into a nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Aiden, an adventurous college student with an affinity for all things aquatic. After a boating accident leaves you stranded on a beach, you seek help at a nearby hotel, the Sublime Wave Resort. Upon entering the building, you discover that the place is empty. There are no guests or staff anywhere in sight. As you wander around the hotel's vast interior, you are overcome by the unshakable feeling that this resort isn't quite what it seems and that <i>something</i> is watching you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/67eefc0ab8eacc299db8b9dcd718604a.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Environments\" width=256 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through the resort. Traverse detailed atmospheric environments such as shimmering swimming pools, dark utility tunnels, a stylish neon-lit water park, and winding dreamlike halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/776d5fe128cc156c0d8a3bbe50164247.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Puzzles\" width=128 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your wits with engaging puzzles while navigating the resort. Find hidden clues and unlock secret paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/1eafeddd5c619434110f056050985c2c.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Enemies\" width=160 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Hostile beings will hunt you down from the murky shadows as you make your way through the building. Distract them, hide, or flee before you meet an untimely demise.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/85aabd674609c7e816e275d584cba412.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Realistic Water Physics\" width=384 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splash around in beautifully rendered dynamic water. Pickup and throw pool toys. Blast water guns. Slide down water slides. Leap from diving boards. Take a nice swim. Just remember to keep an eye on your oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/744d004b135a767bddb385e2f4e4b6bd.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Collectibles\" width=192 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of cute rubber ducks are scattered around the resort. Prove yourself as a master collector and find them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/8b78182f630fc760f0bc051ee27cc2bd.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"\"width=908 height=49 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unending Aqua</strong> is a single-player 3D first-person adventure game with elements of psychological horror. It is inspired by liminal spaces and the poolrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/8b78182f630fc760f0bc051ee27cc2bd.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"\"width=908 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/4dc1af67b52373f7eb3638f417ec2997.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Story\" width=128 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do when your dream vacation turns into a nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Aiden, an adventurous college student with an affinity for all things aquatic. After a boating accident leaves you stranded on a beach, you seek help at a nearby hotel, the Sublime Wave Resort. Upon entering the building, you discover that the place is empty. There are no guests or staff anywhere in sight. As you wander around the hotel's vast interior, you are overcome by the unshakable feeling that this resort isn't quite what it seems and that <i>something</i> is watching you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/67eefc0ab8eacc299db8b9dcd718604a.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Environments\" width=256 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through the resort. Traverse detailed atmospheric environments such as shimmering swimming pools, dark utility tunnels, a stylish neon-lit water park, and winding dreamlike halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/776d5fe128cc156c0d8a3bbe50164247.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Puzzles\" width=128 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your wits with engaging puzzles while navigating the resort. Find hidden clues and unlock secret paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/1eafeddd5c619434110f056050985c2c.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Enemies\" width=160 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Hostile beings will hunt you down from the murky shadows as you make your way through the building. Distract them, hide, or flee before you meet an untimely demise.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/85aabd674609c7e816e275d584cba412.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Realistic Water Physics\" width=384 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splash around in beautifully rendered dynamic water. Pickup and throw pool toys. Blast water guns. Slide down water slides. Leap from diving boards. Take a nice swim. Just remember to keep an eye on your oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/744d004b135a767bddb385e2f4e4b6bd.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"Collectibles\" width=192 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of cute rubber ducks are scattered around the resort. Prove yourself as a master collector and find them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/extras/8b78182f630fc760f0bc051ee27cc2bd.webp?t=1788170126\" alt=\"\"width=908 height=49 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore a mysterious tropical island resort. Collect items and solve puzzles to progress. Survive against dangerous enemies. Piece together the story of the hotel and uncover the dark secrets that it holds.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/95be987018e2c1d4c251e97918f8bc22955b8d75/header.jpg?t=1788170126", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/0f57c96506460db523f25415b4eba2e03496a8ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788170126", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704540/0f57c96506460db523f25415b4eba2e03496a8ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788170126", "website": "https://britneypringlegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>", "recommended